al.\"\n\n\\n\\n\n\n\"The Observer Digital Edition will feature the completed puzzle, providing a valuable resource for those who get stuck while solving the puzzle. However, the real satisfaction comes from solving the puzzle on your own. The challenge of figuring out the correct numbers and placing them in the right cells is what makes Sudoku such a popular game. So, take your time, use your skills and enjoy the process of solving this unique Sudoku puzzle.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.0005287918029353023}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.6523257493972778}, {"token": "following", "logprob": -0.1014167070388794}, {"token": "is", "logprob": -1.9892345666885376}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -1.9073468138230965e-06}, {"token": "description", "logprob": -0.00016544880054425448}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "unique", "logprob": -0.4063818156719208}, {"token": "Sud", "logprob": -0.017388982698321342}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "puzzle", "logprob": -0.00019798702851403505}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.007676979526877403}, {"token": "accompanied", "logprob": -1.5592652559280396}, {"token": "by", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -1.5616295058862306e-05}, {"token": "link", "logprob": -0.00037877538125030696}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -1.1444026313256472e-05}, {"token": "its", "logprob": -0.03804164379835129}, {"token": "print", "logprob": -0.06199304759502411}, {"token": "version", "logprob": -4.076874756719917e-05}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -0.04803881794214249}, {"token": "standard", "logprob": -0.8099358081817627}, {"token": "rules", "logprob": -0.5929840207099915}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -8.487341256113723e-05}, {"token": "Sud", "logprob": -2.50339189733495e-06}, {"token": "oku", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "apply", "logprob": -0.001190430368296802}, {"token": ",", "l